      ],
      "updated": 1794865083516,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "start up quickly\n- so a new one can get on the job fast\n- small is good\n    - better to have 3 services with 4 controllers each than one with 12\n\nStart up time is *especially* important if you are doing 'serverless'\n    - amazon lambda\n        - typescript -> javascript and that is at least an order of magnitude slower than .NET\n    - azure functions\n\n \n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "start up quickly\n- so a new one can get on the job fast\n- small is good\n    - better to have 3 services with 4 controllers each than one with 12\n\nStart up time is *especially* important if you are doing 'serverless'\n    - amazon lambda\n        - typescript -> javascript and that is at least an order of magnitude slower than .NET\n    - azure functions\n\n \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
